                "text": "Grateful for the opportunity to attend the announcement for the University of Kentucky Markey Cancer Center\u2019s National Cancer Institute designation as a Comprehensive Care Canter. \n\nPromoting access to quality healthcare has been one of my top priorities in Congress, and I am thrilled to have such a distinguished cancer research and treatment center in Central Kentucky.",
