                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a fantastic day in Estill and Powell Counties, meeting with community leaders and healthcare providers. \n\nI provided updates on my work in Washington to the Estill County Chamber of Commerce and had the opportunity to meet with Estill Schools Superintendent Charlie Brock. I also visited the Foothills Community Health Center in Clay City, Mercy Health - Marcum and Wallace Hospital in Irvine, and Estill Medical Clinic. Thanks to everyone for your warm hospitality and dedication to our community!",
