                "text": "Great discussion with Dr. Patty Swiney and Dr. Mark Boyd from the American Academy of Family Physicians today. We talked about much-needed fixes to Medicare physician payments and the critical need to modernize prior authorization. I\u2019m committed to supporting our family doctors and ensuring they have the resources they need to provide the best care for their patients.",
